Package: nidesigns
Title: Design Active-Controlled Trials with Non-Inferiority Objectives
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Antonio", "Olivas-Martinez", email = "aolivas@uw.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Fei", "Gao", role = "ctb"),
    person("Holly", "Janes", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: Implements the general framework of Olivas-Martinez, Gao,
    and Janes (2026) for designing and evaluating active-controlled trials
    with non-inferiority objectives. The package supports conditional and
    unconditional operating characteristics, preservation-of-effect and
    inferred-efficacy criteria, and sample-size calculations for hazard
    ratios, relative risks, risk differences, and mean differences.
